From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coop-fetch <coop-fetch@localhost>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:37:43 -0900
Subject: [PATCH] Co-op local co-op: Field of view 150% by default
 (HOS_FOV_DEFAULT)

For oot-remake-multiplayer's local co-op (row 325): several games on one
PC, each in a part of the screen (patch 0047: a half keeps the game's height
at about 8:9), looked zoomed in. HOS_FOV_DEFAULT=<50..150> is the Field of
view a run starts at where the player kept the Insert menu row's own 100%;
the co-op kit's local co-op start sets 150 for each of its games. Through
the menu's env_override: never saved, so a game started alone is unchanged;
a Field of view the player chose stays theirs, and one changed in the menu
during the run is saved as theirs.
---
 gpu/vk/vk_menu.cpp | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/gpu/vk/vk_menu.cpp b/gpu/vk/vk_menu.cpp
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/gpu/vk/vk_menu.cpp
+++ b/gpu/vk/vk_menu.cpp
@@ -4508,6 +4508,14 @@ void menu_init() {
         player_custom_output = custom_output;   // (parse_output replaces the player's own size with the environment's)
         env_override(&opts.output_res, parse_output(e));
     }
+    // (HOS_FOV_DEFAULT=<50..150>: the Field of view this run starts at where the player kept the row's own 100%. Co-op's local
+    // co-op start (several games on one PC, each in a part of the screen: oot-remake-multiplayer's kit, local-coop.ps1
+    // Set-KitLocalEnvironment) sets 150, row 325. A Field of view the player chose stays theirs; the switch is never saved
+    // (env_override, saved_value), so a game started alone is unchanged, and one changed in the menu during the run is saved.)
+    if (const char* e = getenv("HOS_FOV_DEFAULT"); e && *e && opts.fov == 100) {
+        const int v = std::min(std::max((atoi(e) + 2) / 5 * 5, 50), 150);   // (the row's steps: 50 to 150 by 5)
+        if (v != 100) env_override(&opts.fov, v);
+    }
     // (the FSR 4 model for this run: RX_VK_FSR4_MODEL over the saved row; the engine's live value follows the row)
     const int fsr4_env = fsr4_model_env();
     if (fsr4_env >= 0) env_override(&opts.fsr4_model, fsr4_env);
